 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Prohibitions",
   "texto": [
    "**Ikke** goes before the verb in a negative order: **Ikke gå inn!** («Don't come in!»).",
    "**Må ikke + infinitivo** expresses prohibition: **Du må ikke parkere her** («You can't park here.»). It doesn't equal «I don't have to.»."
   ]
